---
layout: base.njk
title: "FAQs"
description: "Answers to frequently asked questions about TUM Grand Venture's business internet, hosted VoIP, disaster recovery, CRM integration, and management consulting services."
---
{% from "partials/icon.njk" import icon %}
{% from "partials/cta-banner.njk" import ctaBanner %}

<!-- ===================== HERO ===================== -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-950">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-dot-grid opacity-20"></div>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-40 top-0 h-[32rem] w-[32rem] rounded-full bg-navy-500/30 blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20 text-center lg:px-12 lg:py-28">
    <span class="eyebrow-dark animate-fade-up">FAQs</span>
    <h1 class="mt-6 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl animate-fade-up [animation-delay:80ms]">
      Frequently Asked Questions
    </h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-300 animate-fade-up [animation-delay:160ms]">
      Answers to the questions we hear most from business owners exploring TUM Grand Venture.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===================== FAQ ACCORDION ===================== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="reveal mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-4" data-faq-group>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200" data-faq-item data-open="false">
      <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left" data-faq-trigger>
        <span class="font-semibold text-navy-900">What services does TUM Grand Venture provide?</span>
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-50 text-gold-600 transition-transform" data-faq-icon>{{ icon("bolt", "h-4 w-4") }}</span>
      </button>
      <div class="overflow-hidden px-6" data-faq-panel style="max-height:0">
        <p class="pb-6 text-slate-600">We provide enterprise-level business internet, hosted VoIP, disaster recovery, CRM integration, and management consulting &mdash; all through 172+ carrier partnerships on a single billing platform.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200" data-faq-item data-open="false">
      <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left" data-faq-trigger>
        <span class="font-semibold text-navy-900">How much can I save by bundling services?</span>
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-50 text-gold-600 transition-transform" data-faq-icon>{{ icon("bolt", "h-4 w-4") }}</span>
      </button>
      <div class="overflow-hidden px-6" data-faq-panel style="max-height:0">
        <p class="pb-6 text-slate-600">Many customers save up to 45% compared to their existing providers when bundling internet, phone, and support services with us.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200" data-faq-item data-open="false">
      <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left" data-faq-trigger>
        <span class="font-semibold text-navy-900">Do you offer a price guarantee?</span>
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-50 text-gold-600 transition-transform" data-faq-icon>{{ icon("bolt", "h-4 w-4") }}</span>
      </button>
      <div class="overflow-hidden px-6" data-faq-panel style="max-height:0">
        <p class="pb-6 text-slate-600">Yes &mdash; we offer a 5-year price guarantee on eligible plans, plus a price match promise if you can provide a verifiable competitor quote.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200" data-faq-item data-open="false">
      <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left" data-faq-trigger>
        <span class="font-semibold text-navy-900">Is TUM Grand Venture a nationwide provider?</span>
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-50 text-gold-600 transition-transform" data-faq-icon>{{ icon("bolt", "h-4 w-4") }}</span>
      </button>
      <div class="overflow-hidden px-6" data-faq-panel style="max-height:0">
        <p class="pb-6 text-slate-600">Yes, we support businesses nationwide with tailored solutions regardless of location or company size.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200" data-faq-item data-open="false">
      <button type="button" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 p-6 text-left" data-faq-trigger>
        <span class="font-semibold text-navy-900">How do I get started?</span>
        <span class="flex h-8 w-8 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-gold-50 text-gold-600 transition-transform" data-faq-icon>{{ icon("bolt", "h-4 w-4") }}</span>
      </button>
      <div class="overflow-hidden px-6" data-faq-panel style="max-height:0">
        <p class="pb-6 text-slate-600">Simply <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-navy-800 underline hover:text-gold-600">contact us</a> for a free, no-obligation consultation. We'll review your needs and recommend the best plan.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{{ ctaBanner(
  heading="Still Have Questions?",
  subheading="Our team is ready to help.",
  primaryText="CONTACT US NOW",
  primaryHref="/contact/"
) }}
